decision: changes-requested

One medium blocker remains: [kept_cache.go:50](/var/tmp/pose-work-go/pose-review-run-1821732801/worktree/pose-mcp/internal/pose/kept_cache.go:50) publishes completed values without enforcing the retention bound. Arbitrarily many distinct pending keys can finish and remain cached indefinitely until another miss. This violates R5 across all four caches.

All three prior findings are fixed. Focused race tests passed, including 100 repetitions of the concurrent-miss tests. `go vet`, artifact checks and surface-check passed. The repository remains unchanged.

